# Smith client config (Vite reads any VITE_* var into the bundle at build time).

# Google Maps Platform API key for Street View Static images on the
# homeowner-side "your home" magic moment. RESTRICT this key in Google Cloud
# Console — HTTP referrers (smith.app/*, *.smith.app/*, localhost:5173/*)
# and API restriction to Street View Static API only. Without restriction,
# anyone with the key can burn through your Maps billing.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
